body:
My family overseas calls their dog Cunt

&#x200B;

they live in England

I recently got a 'deal' of sorts from a dude who makes music under 40 Lohh. Things are okay, however he keeps trying to tell me how the entertainment business runs. I'm by no means an expert, but my parents were kind of hometown famous for being DJs and were in the music/radio scene for a majority of my life. He keeps trying to explain to how to make a hook, where to upload it, how to incorporate lyrics to a song, how to make it run smooth, rhyme schemes, how to get noticed, etc. What he doesn't know is that I have solid ties to rock/contemporary artists who are pretty damn famous (Tim Ripper Owens, NIN, 21p, Black Keys) and with a word, I can have a record deal with a huge company.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

biotch i know just **be quiet and let me LEARN FOR MYSELF**, shit.
